@Customers.Web.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5230
# Access token do Keycloak (vale 5 min), com o audience customers-api. Entre na loja
# (http://localhost:3000) com uma conta confirmada e copie o access_token da chave
# "oidc.user:http://localhost:8080/realms/scorponok:scorponok-web" do localStorage
# (DevTools → Application → Local Storage).
@token = cole-o-access-token-aqui

### Sem token: 401
GET {{Customers.Web.Api_HostAddress}}/customers/me

### Cadastro do cliente do token: 200. Sem cadastro salvo, só o e-mail e o resto null.
GET {{Customers.Web.Api_HostAddress}}/customers/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Salvar (cria ou substitui): 200 com o cadastro. Pontuação aceita; telefone, CPF e CEP
### voltam só com dígitos. O complemento é o único campo opcional.
PUT {{Customers.Web.Api_HostAddress}}/customers/me
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "fullName": "Maria Souza",
  "phone": "(21) 99999-8888",
  "cpf": "529.982.247-25",
  "address": {
    "street": "Rua das Flores",
    "number": "100",
    "complement": "Apto 12",
    "district": "Centro",
    "city": "Rio de Janeiro",
    "state": "RJ",
    "zipCode": "20040-020"
  }
}

### Inválido (CPF e endereço incompleto): 400 com { errors: { "cpf": [...], "address.number": [...] } }
PUT {{Customers.Web.Api_HostAddress}}/customers/me
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "fullName": "Maria Souza",
  "phone": "(21) 99999-8888",
  "cpf": "111.111.111-11",
  "address": {
    "street": "Rua das Flores",
    "zipCode": "20040-020"
  }
}

### Saúde: live (processo), ready (banco) e bus (RabbitMQ, 503 sem o broker)
GET {{Customers.Web.Api_HostAddress}}/health/ready

###

# GraphQL (subgraph do gateway; a loja usa o gateway em http://localhost:5200/graphql). Mesma regra do
# REST: sem token → AUTH_NOT_AUTHENTICATED; e-mail não confirmado → AUTH_NOT_AUTHORIZED.
POST {{Customers.Web.Api_HostAddress}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "query": "{ me { email fullName phone cpf address { street number complement district city state zipCode } } }" }

###

# Salvar: os erros voltam por campo (errors { field messages }), com profile nulo e nada gravado.
POST {{Customers.Web.Api_HostAddress}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "query": "mutation($input: UpdateMyProfileInput!) { updateMyProfile(input: $input) { profile { email fullName cpf } errors { field messages } } }",
  "variables": { "input": { "fullName": "Maria Souza", "phone": "(11) 99999-8888", "cpf": "111.111.111-11",
    "address": { "street": "Rua das Flores", "number": "100", "district": "Centro", "city": "São Paulo", "state": "SP", "zipCode": "01000-000" } } }
}

###
